        "§": {"item": "whiteboard", "props": {"face": "e", "title": "Clutch log", "text": "CLUTCH LOG · 3-A\n\nHOST 11 · implanted 22:10 · hatched 22:11:30 · 4 larvae\nHOST 12 · implanted 23:02 · purged 23:03 (I.B.: “why?”)\nHOST 13 · implanted 00:40 · hatched · 5 larvae\n\nIn red: STOP PURGING THE HOSTS. — I.B."}},
