        "«": {"item": "ds-tenant-tank", "props": {"empty": false, "title": "Specimen tank", "kicker": "Lab 3-B", "text": "SPECIMEN: TENANT (JUVENILE)\nTEMPLATE: S. PELL\n\nIt turns, slowly, in the green. When you lean in, it turns toward you."}},
        "¬": {"item": "ds-tenant-tank", "props": {"empty": true, "title": "Specimen tank", "kicker": "Lab 3-B", "text": "TANK DRAINED 02:14\nOCCUPANT: NOT PRESENT"}},
        "®": {"item": "ds-specimen-file", "props": {"dir": "w", "title": "Specimen file 3-B-02 · “Tenant”", "kicker": "Lab 3-B", "flags": ["fileTenant", "sawProject"], "text": "SPECIMEN 3-B-02 · “TENANT”\nCLASS: macroscopic synthid, neural parasite\nTEMPLATE SOURCE: S. PELL\n\nSeeks a recently dead host. Enters at the base of the skull and takes the spinal cord for its own. The host stands, walks, and goes back to the places it knew.\n\nTenancy of a living host has not yet been achieved. (Trials ongoing. Volunteers: 9.)\n\nThe host’s vocal cords remain functional. The Tenant does not use them. The host does.\n\nDISPOSAL: destroy the host, then the Tenant. In that order.", "ariadne": "VOLUNTEERS 1 TO 9 WERE DONORS FROM RECEIVING."}},
        "°": {"item": "ds-autopsy-table", "props": {"dir": "s", "covered": true, "title": "A steel table", "kicker": "Lab 3-B", "text": "Under the sheet, somebody small, lying on their front. There is a neat round hole at the base of the skull, and the edges of it are healed."}},
        "±": {"item": "ds-autopsy-table", "props": {"dir": "s", "covered": false, "title": "A steel table", "kicker": "Lab 3-B", "text": "Straps, at the wrists and the ankles and, oddly, the forehead. They’ve been undone from the inside."}},
        "²": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"host": true, "title": "Dr. Ana Lucero", "kicker": "Lab 3-B", "angle": 0.8, "color": "#e8ecee", "skin": "#d8b090", "hair": "#3a2418", "text": "Dr. Ana Lucero. Lab 3-B. They died early in the night, and they are lying very straight, as if somebody arranged them to be found. Or used."}},
