        "»": {"item": "desk", "props": {"dir": "n"}},
        "¼": {"item": "ds-note", "props": {"title": "Okafor’s logbook", "kicker": "Lab 3-B", "text": "P.O. · LOGBOOK\n\n01:50 · S.P. here again to watch the trials. He takes notes on how they walk.\n02:14 · Alarms. The tanks are draining. I’ve taken Ilse’s spare card from her office: if this gets bad I’m going up Stair B with it, whatever Voss says.\n02:20 · One of them is out. It went for Ruth. Ruth is\n02:31 · If anyone reads this: it goes back to where the body worked. Find my desk and you’ll find me. Take the card off me. I won’t mind."}},
