        "À": {"item": "ds-cell-sign", "props": {"face": "s", "label": "PHOTOPHORE TANK", "status": "CONTAINED", "text": "SPECIMEN: LANTERN (×2)\nTEMPLATE: M. THALE\nLIGHT OUTPUT: 40 LUX EACH\n\nThey drift to the glass whenever anybody stands here. It feels like being looked at by two lamps."}},
        "Á": {"item": "ds-specimen-file", "props": {"dir": "e", "title": "Specimen file 3-D-11 · “Lantern”", "kicker": "Lab 3-D", "flags": ["fileLantern", "sawProject"], "text": "SPECIMEN 3-D-11 · “LANTERN”\nCLASS: macroscopic synthid, photophore\nTEMPLATE SOURCE: M. THALE\n\nA buoyant sac of living tissue, lit from within. Drifts toward warmth. Feeds by spitting a digestive bile, and drifting back later.\n\nBILE: infectious. Exposed staff to decontamination before symptoms (fever; then the lights).\n\nLIGHT OUTPUT: 40 lux. The light is not the Lantern’s own. It is the last host’s.\n\nCOMMERCIAL APPLICATION: low-maintenance emergency lighting.\n(Marketing: please stop calling them “angels”.)", "ariadne": "THE LIGHT IN EACH ONE IS A PERSON. THEY ARE NOT FINISHED BEING USED."}},
        "Â": {"item": "ds-lab-bench", "props": {"dir": "s", "w": 2, "kit": "scope", "title": "A light bench", "kicker": "Lab 3-D", "text": "A light meter, a blackout hood, and a row of numbers in pencil: 38, 40, 41, 40, 12, 0. Next to the 0, someone has written “host deceased (finally)”."}},
        "Ã": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"title": "Dev Raman", "kicker": "Lab 3-D · technician", "angle": -1.2, "color": "#3a6a5a", "skin": "#8a6a4a", "hair": "#141010", "text": "Dev ran the light tests. He is lying in the dark with his torch still in his hand, switched off. Maybe he thought they couldn’t find him without it."}},
