        "È": {"item": "ds-cell-sign", "props": {"face": "w", "label": "PEN 1", "status": "CONTAINED", "text": "JUVENILE COLONY 1\nTEMPLATE: S. PELL\nHOSTS: 3\nFEEDING: ONE DONOR PER WEEK, BY THE HATCH (RECEIVING, F1)\n\nThere are faces in it. One of them is very young.", "flags": []}},
        "É": {"item": "ds-cell-sign", "props": {"face": "w", "label": "PEN 2", "status": "CONTAINED", "text": "JUVENILE COLONY 2\nTEMPLATE: S. PELL\nHOSTS: 4\nFEEDING: ONE DONOR PER WEEK, BY THE HATCH (RECEIVING, F1)\n\nThere are faces in it. One of them is very young.", "flags": []}},
        "Ê": {"item": "ds-cell-sign", "props": {"face": "w", "label": "PEN 3", "status": "CONTAINED", "text": "JUVENILE COLONY 3\nTEMPLATE: S. PELL\nHOSTS: 2\nFEEDING: ONE DONOR PER WEEK, BY THE HATCH (RECEIVING, F1)\n\nThere are faces in it. One of them is very young.", "flags": []}},
        "Ë": {"item": "ds-cell-sign", "props": {"face": "w", "label": "PEN 4", "status": "TRANSFERRED", "text": "COLONY 4 · TRANSFERRED 14 MARCH\nTO: SHELTER B AIR RETURN (F2)\nAUTHORITY: A. VOSS\n\nThe pen is empty. Its feeding hatch hangs open, and the air duct has been unbolted and taken out of the wall.\n\nYou know where Colony 4 went. You met it.", "flags": ["fileColony", "sawProject"]}},
        "Ì": {"item": "ds-vent", "props": {"face": "w"}},
        "Í": {"item": "ds-specimen-file", "props": {"dir": "e", "title": "Specimen file 3-E-05 · “Congregation”", "kicker": "Lab 3-E", "flags": ["fileColony", "sawProject"], "text": "SPECIMEN 3-E-05 · “CONGREGATION” (juvenile colonies ×4)\nCLASS: macroscopic synthid, colonial\nTEMPLATE SOURCE: S. PELL\n\nA colony begins as one host. It keeps what it takes: the face, the voice, the habits. Mature colonies have been heard arguing among themselves, in the voices of their hosts.\n\nFEEDING: one donor per colony per week (Receiving, F1).\n\nFIELD TRIAL 1 · APPROVED 14 MARCH · A. VOSS\n  Colony 4 moved to the Shelter B air return (F2).\n  Purpose: growth on a sheltered population during a containment event.\n  Status: event pending.", "ariadne": "EVENT PENDING WAS TONIGHT."}},
        "Î": {"item": "chair", "props": {"dir": "e"}},
        "Ï": {"item": "desk", "props": {"dir": "e"}},
        "Ð": {"item": "ds-note", "props": {"title": "A keeper’s note", "kicker": "Lab 3-E", "text": "Pen 2 sang again tonight. All four of its voices, a round, like at school. I asked the Director if we could stop the feeding for a week and see if it stopped. He asked me which one was singing loudest.\n\nIt was the girl."}},
        "Ñ": {"item": "ds-body", "props": {"title": "Agnes Holm", "kicker": "Lab 3-E · keeper", "angle": 0.4, "color": "#5a4a3a", "skin": "#f0d4b8", "hair": "#d8d0c0", "text": "Agnes kept the colonies fed. She is sitting with her back to the pens, facing the door, a fire axe across her knees. Whatever she was waiting for never came out of the pens. Something else came in through the door."}},
        "Ò": {"item": "ds-trauma-kit"},
