        "Õ": {"item": "ds-console", "props": {"dir": "s", "flag": "knowsOkafor", "once": false, "prompt": "Use her terminal", "kicker": "Dr. Brandt’s office", "title": "Card reads · Floor 3", "text": "CLEARANCE 3 · CARD READS · F3 · TONIGHT\n\nBRANDT.I .... 01:52 · STAIR B (UP)\nSPARE ....... 02:16 · signed out · OKAFOR.P\nOKAFOR.P .... 02:20 · LAB 3-B\nOKAFOR.P .... 02:51 · LAB 3-B\nOKAFOR.P .... 03:22 · LAB 3-B\nOKAFOR.P .... 03:53 · LAB 3-B\nOKAFOR.P .... 04:24 · LAB 3-B (door: inside → inside)\n\nEvery thirty-one minutes, all night, the same door."}},
        "Ö": {"item": "ds-note", "props": {"title": "The top drawer", "kicker": "Dr. Brandt’s office", "text": "The top drawer, where the spare card lives, is empty. There’s a sticky note in its place, in a neat hand:\n\n“Ilse — took the spare. If this is what I think it is, I want a way out. — P.”"}},
        "×": {"item": "bookshelf", "props": {"dir": "e", "text": "Bound volumes: ONEIROGRAPHY, VOL. I–IX. The spines are labelled by dreamer, not by year. BRANDT, I. takes up a whole shelf."}},
