        "Ý": {"item": "ds-specimen-file", "props": {"dir": "s", "title": "Cell S-41", "kicker": "Observation", "flags": ["fileS41", "sawProject"], "text": "CELL S-41 · EMPTY\n\nSPECIMEN 41 · TRANSFERRED TO F5 (THE DIRECTOR’S COLLECTION) · 2 MARCH\nTEMPLATE SOURCE: A. VOSS (REM cycle 4)\n\nDo not attempt to describe Specimen 41 in writing.\nDo not attempt to describe it to the Director. He knows.", "ariadne": "IT IS UPSTAIRS. HE KEEPS IT WHERE HE CAN WATCH IT."}},
